1
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:04,850
I will have to offer
my gratitude to Lord Ains,

2
00:00:04,850 --> 00:00:08,510
for allowing this many
of our membership to gather for this.

3
00:00:09,150 --> 00:00:12,070
I, Demiurge, have been granted
all authority for this,

4
00:00:12,070 --> 00:00:16,410
by the word of Lord Ains.
Sebas, do you object?

5
00:00:16,410 --> 00:00:17,990
Of course not.

6
00:00:17,990 --> 00:00:21,620
Then I hope you are not
under any mistaken impressions.

7
00:00:21,620 --> 00:00:23,580
The reason why
our membership has assembled

8
00:00:23,580 --> 00:00:26,460
is to execute Eight Fingers,
who were foolish enough

9
00:00:26,460 --> 00:00:30,300
to spit in the honored faces
of the Supreme Ones.

10
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:36,300
I understand that. Rescuing Tuare
is a secondary objective.

11
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:41,430
That is correct. I share your hope
that Tuare be rescued alive,

12
00:00:41,430 --> 00:00:46,310
because I do not believe that
she can withstand resurrection magic.

13
00:00:47,190 --> 00:00:51,320
So then, Demiurge, do we have
any information on Eight Fingers?

14
00:00:51,690 --> 00:00:53,570
Oh, I don't think that will be a problem.

15
00:00:53,570 --> 00:00:56,950
We've already obtained information
on locations for seven of their bases.

16
00:00:58,660 --> 00:01:01,540
Also, Sebas, allow me to apologize upfront,

17
00:01:01,540 --> 00:01:05,870
but I cannot reveal the full scope
of the plans I am about to lay out to you.

18
00:01:05,870 --> 00:01:09,790
Since you will return to Nazarick
immediately after Tuare is recovered,

19
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:11,380
you will no longer be concerned with them.

20
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:13,560
I understand.

21
00:01:16,510 --> 00:01:20,010
Solution, I ask that you back Sebas up.

22
00:01:20,010 --> 00:01:22,510
Very well, Lord Demiurge.

23
00:01:22,930 --> 00:01:26,270
Next, I must convey
an important matter to you.

24
00:01:26,270 --> 00:01:27,440
Entoma?

25
00:01:27,440 --> 00:01:28,770
Acknowledged.

26
00:01:31,520 --> 00:01:35,190
You are forbidden to kill this person.
Especially you, Shalltear.

27
00:01:35,190 --> 00:01:38,540
Okay, I get it!
You don't have to single me out!

28
00:01:38,910 --> 00:01:41,410
Hmm? What is it, Shadow Demon?

29
00:01:42,620 --> 00:01:48,080
I see. It appears we now have
one more Eight Fingers base to attack.

30
00:01:48,080 --> 00:01:52,020
Mare, I want you to head there with Entoma.

31
00:01:52,630 --> 00:01:55,550
Right. Um, please, leave them to us.

32
00:01:56,630 --> 00:02:02,590
We must show Lord Ains that we are
of service to him through this mission.

33
00:02:03,390 --> 00:02:05,720
Failure is not an option. On the contrary,

34
00:02:05,720 --> 00:02:09,560
see that you provide results that will
wipe the slate clean of any mistakes.

35
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:11,480
Wh-What about me?

36
00:02:11,480 --> 00:02:14,110
Shalltear, I hate to do this to you,
but you stand down.

37
00:02:14,110 --> 00:02:18,070
Ah, I am concerned
about your Blood Frenzy.

38
00:02:18,070 --> 00:02:22,120
O-Okay, fine! That's just fine!

39
00:02:23,530 --> 00:02:30,000
Now, let me detail the second stage
of the plan, "Gehenna."

40
00:04:10,100 --> 00:04:12,430
That's such nice mythril armor, right?

41
00:04:12,430 --> 00:04:14,270
Are you sure you want to dye it like that?

42
00:04:14,270 --> 00:04:18,270
I got it from Princess Renner,
but it just stands out too much.

43
00:04:18,650 --> 00:04:22,900
However, it's virtually silent,
so I think it's suitable for infiltrating.

44
00:04:23,280 --> 00:04:26,410
Captains, gather around!
We're going to go over the plan!

45
00:04:30,910 --> 00:04:33,120
We are about to launch a simultaneous raid

46
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:35,500
on eight buildings in Eight Fingers' possession,

47
00:04:35,500 --> 00:04:37,170
and take control of them.

48
00:04:37,170 --> 00:04:39,290
But we only have seven squads.

49
00:04:39,290 --> 00:04:41,550
Once we've taken control
of our assigned buildings,

50
00:04:41,550 --> 00:04:44,840
those of us here will head for
the last location that we've identified.

51
00:04:44,840 --> 00:04:47,590
In other words, first come, first served, right?

52
00:04:47,970 --> 00:04:51,140
Our enemy is a force of heavyweights
who control an underground society.

53
00:04:51,140 --> 00:04:52,570
Be plenty cautious.

54
00:04:55,690 --> 00:04:57,690
The squads are all ready.

55
00:04:57,690 --> 00:05:01,280
There are some former
orichalcum class adventurers here, too,

56
00:05:01,280 --> 00:05:02,480
courtesy of Marquis Raeven.

57
00:05:02,780 --> 00:05:04,990
Lockmeyer. Nice to meet you.

58
00:05:05,740 --> 00:05:07,240
Hey, virgin!

59
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:10,120
Miss Gagaran, is something the matter?

60
00:05:10,120 --> 00:05:13,060
Oh, I was just thinking you might be nervous,

61
00:05:13,060 --> 00:05:16,120
so maybe I'd give you
a pat on your virgin behind.

62
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:19,500
You must be Brain Unglaus.

63
00:05:19,500 --> 00:05:20,920
Indeed...

64
00:05:21,420 --> 00:05:23,880
--Do I pass?
--Huh?

65
00:05:23,880 --> 00:05:29,140
She's here to check out if I'm a warrior
she can entrust with you, Climb.

66
00:05:29,140 --> 00:05:30,260
Is that true?

67
00:05:30,260 --> 00:05:35,100
Hell no! It doesn't matter to me
what happens to you.

68
00:05:35,100 --> 00:05:37,520
But with you along,
things should go more easily.

69
00:05:37,520 --> 00:05:42,650
Best not to get too careless. There are
any number of monsters in this world.

70
00:05:42,650 --> 00:05:47,610
Ho, so you're the prudent type.
I'm not averse to a man like that.

71
00:05:47,610 --> 00:05:50,160
You're probably not a virgin,
but what do you say?

72
00:05:50,160 --> 00:05:53,330
I think I'll pass. I'd likely
get crushed under the pressure.

73
00:05:53,330 --> 00:05:55,830
Oh, yeah? That's too bad.

74
00:05:55,830 --> 00:05:57,960
Climb, you watch yourself.

75
00:05:57,960 --> 00:05:59,170
R-Right!

76
00:06:00,130 --> 00:06:01,960
She's a nice enough lady.

77
00:06:01,960 --> 00:06:04,380
Everyone in the Blue Rose is nice.

78
00:06:05,340 --> 00:06:07,300
Well, we should get going, too.

79
00:06:07,300 --> 00:06:08,130
Right.

80
00:06:14,470 --> 00:06:17,180
Wait, wait! It's me! I just got back.

81
00:06:17,180 --> 00:06:18,720
Mr. Lockmeyer...

82
00:06:19,350 --> 00:06:22,860
After using invisibility magic
and sneaking in, I learned two things--

83
00:06:22,860 --> 00:06:25,900
There's a woman being held captive
in the building's prison cell.

84
00:06:25,900 --> 00:06:29,200
Also, there are five people here who
fit the description of Six Arms members.

85
00:06:29,200 --> 00:06:33,200
That... is terrible news,
but it's also terrific news, isn't it?

86
00:06:33,200 --> 00:06:35,620
If Six Arms is gathered here,

87
00:06:35,620 --> 00:06:38,620
it means that the other locations
will fall pretty easily.

88
00:06:38,620 --> 00:06:40,170
So what do we do?

89
00:06:40,170 --> 00:06:43,750
It's going to be impossible
for just us to take this place.

90
00:06:43,750 --> 00:06:44,750
We fall back.

91
00:06:44,750 --> 00:06:47,260
You're right. We have no choice--

92
00:06:48,760 --> 00:06:49,750
Is that...?

93
00:06:53,140 --> 00:06:56,140
What a coincidence,
running into you fellows here.

94
00:06:56,140 --> 00:06:58,890
Lord Sebas, what are you
doing here at this hour?

95
00:06:59,390 --> 00:07:04,150
As it happens, the woman that
I mentioned saving has been kidnapped.

96
00:07:04,150 --> 00:07:07,030
I am here because I received a summons.

97
00:07:07,030 --> 00:07:08,460
Then she must be...

98
00:07:08,900 --> 00:07:11,910
Can you tell us more
about the woman in the cell?

99
00:07:11,910 --> 00:07:13,020
Mm-hmm.

100
00:07:14,660 --> 00:07:15,870
I see...

101
00:07:16,410 --> 00:07:20,370
Then five of the Six Arms
are grouped together here?

102
00:07:20,370 --> 00:07:25,000
Lord Sebas, if you are willing,
would you mind working with us?

103
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:29,350
Of course. I was called to be here, after all.

104
00:07:29,970 --> 00:07:33,010
So then, I will take on the Six Arms members.

105
00:07:33,010 --> 00:07:34,890
Thank you very much.

106
00:07:34,890 --> 00:07:39,640
I will go in through the front.
While I have the enemy's attention,

107
00:07:39,640 --> 00:07:42,480
I would appreciate it if you could rescue Tuare.

108
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:43,850
Understood!

109
00:07:43,850 --> 00:07:45,980
What should those of us sneaking in do?

110
00:07:45,980 --> 00:07:47,360
With just the three of us,

111
00:07:47,360 --> 00:07:51,530
our magic caster should be able
to cast an invisibility spell on us.

112
00:07:51,900 --> 00:07:54,280
The other squad members
aren't up for sneaking in,

113
00:07:54,280 --> 00:07:56,280
thanks to the sound their armor makes.

114
00:07:56,280 --> 00:07:59,040
I swear, we will bring
Miss Tuare back safely with us.

115
00:07:59,040 --> 00:08:00,960
I would be much obliged.

116
00:08:04,250 --> 00:08:06,540
Right on time. Come in.

117
00:08:17,180 --> 00:08:18,720
We've been expecting you.

118
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:20,930
We're looking forward to some more today.

119
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:24,440
Aren't there... supposed to be five of you?

120
00:08:24,440 --> 00:08:27,900
Old man, I hear you're quite strong.

121
00:08:27,900 --> 00:08:32,070
Don't tell me <i>you're</i> the one
who defeated Succulent.

122
00:08:32,070 --> 00:08:34,030
I don't care if he is a has-been,

123
00:08:34,030 --> 00:08:36,980
having one of the Six Arms be defeated
right in front of Cocco Doll,

124
00:08:36,980 --> 00:08:39,830
chief of the slave trade,
is embarrassing beyond words.

125
00:08:40,160 --> 00:08:44,960
Well, he insisted that
he was beaten by Brain Unglaus.

126
00:08:45,290 --> 00:08:49,670
Either way, old man, you're the one
that started all this trouble.

127
00:08:49,670 --> 00:08:52,720
We'll kill you first. Look up there.

128
00:08:54,220 --> 00:08:58,100
There are bigwigs
from all over sitting up there.

129
00:08:58,430 --> 00:09:02,350
They're here to watch us torture you to death.

130
00:09:02,730 --> 00:09:05,350
Is that Zero fellow up there, as well?

131
00:09:05,350 --> 00:09:07,150
Why, yes he is.

132
00:09:09,690 --> 00:09:13,240
What was that? Are you trying to pick a fight?

133
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:14,650
Please pay it no mind.

134
00:09:14,990 --> 00:09:18,410
Now, where is she? Where is Tuare?

135
00:09:18,410 --> 00:09:20,280
What if I said she was dead?

136
00:09:20,870 --> 00:09:23,890
Would you really be that kind to her?

137
00:09:24,710 --> 00:09:28,210
You're right. We <i>wouldn't</i> be that kind.

138
00:09:28,210 --> 00:09:33,170
The woman is one of the gifts we have
for Cocco Doll. She's safely secure.

139
00:09:36,550 --> 00:09:39,510
Since you're all here,
all of you attack me at once.

140
00:09:39,510 --> 00:09:42,350
Do so, and you will last at least ten seconds.

141
00:09:42,350 --> 00:09:45,350
Listen to you, you human!

142
00:09:45,350 --> 00:09:49,230
I'm sure he must not have ever
met anyone who was truly strong before.

143
00:09:49,230 --> 00:09:52,110
Well, okay. We'll take you on.

144
00:09:53,730 --> 00:09:56,240
Malmvist, of the Thousand Kills.

145
00:09:56,820 --> 00:10:01,240
EdstrÃ¶m, of the Dancing Scimitar.

146
00:10:03,830 --> 00:10:05,870
Peshurian, of the Spatial Slash.

147
00:10:06,370 --> 00:10:09,380
And me, Davernoch, the Undead King.

148
00:10:09,710 --> 00:10:11,880
Undead King, you say?

149
00:10:12,880 --> 00:10:15,420
An overblown nickname for a fool such as you!

150
00:10:26,980 --> 00:10:30,350
There is only one person in this world

151
00:10:30,350 --> 00:10:32,190
who can claim the nickname of "Undead King."

152
00:10:32,610 --> 00:10:35,940
The presumptuousness
of an inferior undead like you!

153
00:10:37,440 --> 00:10:39,570
Solution! Did you find Zero?

154
00:10:39,570 --> 00:10:42,070
He does not appear to be here.

155
00:10:43,450 --> 00:10:46,160
That means another ten seconds.

156
00:10:49,420 --> 00:10:50,480
Here it is.

157
00:10:55,590 --> 00:10:57,090
Are you Miss Tuare?

158
00:11:16,860 --> 00:11:18,820
What is going on?!

159
00:11:26,870 --> 00:11:28,660
Say there, little girl...

160
00:11:32,250 --> 00:11:33,290
...or boy...?

161
00:11:35,250 --> 00:11:37,550
What are you doing in here?

162
00:11:37,550 --> 00:11:41,800
L-Lady, are you the most important
person in the mansion?

163
00:11:41,800 --> 00:11:46,930
No--er, yes I am. I'm the
most important person in the mansion.

164
00:11:46,930 --> 00:11:50,080
S-So you are. Thank goodness.

165
00:11:57,820 --> 00:12:00,780
Um, so anyway, uh, we're leaving.

166
00:12:02,990 --> 00:12:05,140
Ah! My leg!

167
00:12:06,450 --> 00:12:09,500
Ow! Ow! Stop! Oh, stop!

168
00:12:09,500 --> 00:12:12,040
We have to hurry and get going.

169
00:12:12,040 --> 00:12:14,670
I'll let you handle things from here.

170
00:12:14,670 --> 00:12:16,090
Okay!

171
00:12:18,050 --> 00:12:22,420
Everybody, keep moving the last
of that stuff quickly, okay?

172
00:12:23,340 --> 00:12:28,060
Mmm... Ah, I haven't eaten it yet!
Oopsie, oopsie!

173
00:12:29,970 --> 00:12:34,730
Nothing beats man flesh when dieting, huh?

174
00:12:34,730 --> 00:12:38,610
Yo! What are you munching down on
that seems so tasty to you?

175
00:12:39,070 --> 00:12:40,280
Some meat.

176
00:12:40,280 --> 00:12:42,530
From a human.

177
00:12:42,530 --> 00:12:48,410
You don't say. I didn't think that
Eight Fingers kept any monsters!

178
00:12:48,410 --> 00:12:53,080
You know what? Can we pretend
like we never saw each other?

179
00:12:53,080 --> 00:12:57,880
Sorry about this, but I'm one of
the top adventurers in the kingdom.

180
00:12:57,880 --> 00:13:02,050
I can't very well say "Oh, okay"
to a man-eating monster and let it go.

181
00:13:02,050 --> 00:13:05,550
This is so much trouble. Still, you're strong.

182
00:13:06,050 --> 00:13:08,680
Maybe I'll turn you into preserved food.

183
00:13:13,270 --> 00:13:15,270
Huh? Is running away all you can do?

184
00:13:15,980 --> 00:13:19,900
Hmm, you sure love
whooshing that thing around.

185
00:13:19,900 --> 00:13:21,320
I'll smash you!

186
00:13:25,570 --> 00:13:29,740
These are the finest clothes,
given to me by the Supreme Being.

187
00:13:33,370 --> 00:13:34,080
Wha--?!

188
00:13:35,540 --> 00:13:37,210
What was that?!

189
00:13:37,830 --> 00:13:39,280
Hard Armor Bug!

190
00:13:39,840 --> 00:13:46,260
You see, I'm an entomancer.
So I summon insects like this...

191
00:13:46,260 --> 00:13:47,590
Blade Bug!

192
00:13:50,930 --> 00:13:53,350
...and then I can use them!

193
00:13:53,680 --> 00:13:57,850
I'll kill you now.
I really didn't intend to kill you,

194
00:13:57,850 --> 00:13:59,610
but I can't have this anymore!

195
00:14:02,940 --> 00:14:07,150
You've changed the way you move!
So now you're taking this seriously?!

196
00:14:19,880 --> 00:14:21,380
Thanks, Tia.

197
00:14:21,380 --> 00:14:23,130
Ninja skills?

198
00:14:23,130 --> 00:14:26,340
So Gagaran, your blood flows red, too?

199
00:14:26,340 --> 00:14:28,800
What are you so surprised about?

200
00:14:28,800 --> 00:14:32,010
I thought by now your blood would flow blue.

201
00:14:32,010 --> 00:14:33,680
Like a power-up.

202
00:14:33,680 --> 00:14:35,390
I haven't changed races.

203
00:14:35,390 --> 00:14:37,180
Then, a class change.

204
00:14:37,180 --> 00:14:39,270
Are you just about ready yet?

205
00:14:39,270 --> 00:14:41,770
Spider Talisman!

206
00:14:43,900 --> 00:14:45,820
Shadow Clone Technique!

207
00:14:49,280 --> 00:14:50,940
Hard Bullet Bugs!

208
00:14:58,540 --> 00:15:00,550
Immovable Adamantine Shield Technique!

209
00:15:08,800 --> 00:15:09,800
What is this?!

210
00:15:09,800 --> 00:15:12,180
She defended without even looking at me!

211
00:15:12,180 --> 00:15:13,260
She has a wide field of view?

212
00:15:13,260 --> 00:15:15,680
It's not just that; it's something else.

213
00:15:16,220 --> 00:15:19,560
This is bad. I don't have
the slightest notion that we can win.

214
00:15:20,480 --> 00:15:23,080
I don't need these bugs anymore.

215
00:15:24,190 --> 00:15:26,450
In their place, come here...

216
00:15:28,440 --> 00:15:32,990
Oops. I thought I'd filled up earlier, too.

217
00:15:32,990 --> 00:15:36,910
Must be all the exercise I'm getting,
but I'm getting hungry again.

218
00:15:43,420 --> 00:15:44,380
Flame Burst!

219
00:15:46,880 --> 00:15:48,760
Thunderbird Talisman!

220
00:15:50,380 --> 00:15:54,180
Damn it, I hate things that slither!

221
00:15:54,180 --> 00:15:55,030
Tia!

222
00:15:59,770 --> 00:16:01,890
Thunderbird Swarm Talismans!

223
00:16:07,940 --> 00:16:08,970
Tia!

224
00:16:09,530 --> 00:16:10,740
Explosive Talisman!

225
00:16:13,360 --> 00:16:16,160
Sharp Cutting Talisman!
Piercing Wind Talisman!

226
00:16:19,790 --> 00:16:20,620
Tia!

227
00:16:20,950 --> 00:16:22,370
You insect punk!

228
00:16:22,370 --> 00:16:24,500
This wasn't the order I was going to eat you in,

229
00:16:24,500 --> 00:16:28,630
but she looks pretty filling,
as well as tasty, so I guess it's fine.

230
00:16:33,050 --> 00:16:35,430
Why don't you stop right there?

231
00:16:35,430 --> 00:16:36,680
Who are you?

232
00:16:36,680 --> 00:16:41,680
Is a man-eating monster wearing
a maid uniform supposed to be a joke?

233
00:16:41,680 --> 00:16:44,480
I can't imagine anyone would be delighted

234
00:16:44,480 --> 00:16:46,440
to have a monster like you attending to them,

235
00:16:46,440 --> 00:16:49,070
with the stench of blood hanging over you.

236
00:16:49,070 --> 00:16:51,360
What did you just say?

237
00:16:51,360 --> 00:16:52,190
Evileye...

238
00:16:52,190 --> 00:16:55,660
I was wondering what
you were up to, but good grief.

239
00:16:55,660 --> 00:16:57,950
Give some thought to
the difference in your abilities!

240
00:16:57,950 --> 00:17:00,360
This one is stronger than you two.

241
00:17:00,910 --> 00:17:03,510
She's also weaker than I am.

242
00:17:03,910 --> 00:17:07,840
How dare you push
my friends around, you monster!

243
00:17:08,540 --> 00:17:12,840
No one would be delighted
to have me attend to them, you say?

244
00:17:13,220 --> 00:17:15,840
You can be smashed
right alongside your friends!

245
00:17:16,260 --> 00:17:18,510
Hmph, what a ridiculous attack.

246
00:17:18,510 --> 00:17:20,220
Reverse Gravity!

247
00:17:24,520 --> 00:17:28,190
Gagaran, you're in the way!
Go heal Tia's wounds, or something!

248
00:17:33,740 --> 00:17:37,360
Are you with that Demon God...?! In that case...

249
00:17:37,360 --> 00:17:38,730
Vermin Bane!

250
00:17:47,330 --> 00:17:49,000
What kind of magic is that?

251
00:17:49,000 --> 00:17:53,960
Insecticide magic-- "Vermin Bane."
It's my own original magic spell.

252
00:17:54,590 --> 00:17:55,830
Her face is dissolving.

253
00:18:00,470 --> 00:18:03,220
Are you telling me that was a bug mask?

254
00:18:09,360 --> 00:18:13,110
A Lip Bug? It devours the vocal cords
of its human victims,

255
00:18:13,110 --> 00:18:15,440
allowing it to produce their voice.

256
00:18:15,440 --> 00:18:18,660
How dare you... How dare you!

257
00:18:18,660 --> 00:18:20,950
Your voice is a lot more
endearing like this, isn't it?

258
00:18:20,950 --> 00:18:23,200
I rather like your voice this way.

259
00:18:23,660 --> 00:18:26,870
You humans!!

260
00:18:33,500 --> 00:18:35,300
Tch! Vermin Bane!

261
00:18:39,590 --> 00:18:43,350
You're the only one...
You're the only one I have to fear...

262
00:18:43,350 --> 00:18:48,350
If I can just kill you, everything else
will go down like a simple job.

263
00:18:48,850 --> 00:18:50,350
Immobilizing Paralysis Technique!

264
00:18:54,530 --> 00:18:55,830
Crystal Lance!

265
00:19:00,780 --> 00:19:02,120
Vermin Bane!

266
00:19:07,540 --> 00:19:10,220
This is unlike earlier. Crystal Wall!

267
00:19:15,670 --> 00:19:17,510
Did you hear that just now?

268
00:19:17,510 --> 00:19:20,010
How can her maid uniform and
my armor have the same hardness?

269
00:19:20,010 --> 00:19:20,970
It's not possible!

270
00:19:20,970 --> 00:19:24,890
Your attack that stings me is getting tedious!

271
00:19:24,890 --> 00:19:26,390
What do we do?

272
00:19:26,390 --> 00:19:29,230
Attack her all at once with some
heavy firepower to wear her down.

273
00:19:29,230 --> 00:19:31,650
That's an answer easy enough
for me to understand.

274
00:19:32,260 --> 00:19:34,400
Okay, let's take it to her.

275
00:19:36,280 --> 00:19:37,920
Acid Splash!

276
00:19:38,610 --> 00:19:40,070
Explosive Talisman!

277
00:19:40,070 --> 00:19:42,030
Immovable Adamantine Shield Technique!

278
00:19:42,030 --> 00:19:43,400
Vermin Bane!

279
00:19:48,830 --> 00:19:50,010
We've beaten her.

280
00:19:53,670 --> 00:19:54,960
I'll finish her off.

281
00:19:54,960 --> 00:19:56,380
Right.

282
00:19:58,510 --> 00:20:01,410
Can I ask you to stop there?

283
00:20:03,930 --> 00:20:06,470
Hey, is that one of Evileye's kin?

284
00:20:06,890 --> 00:20:11,310
Are you all right? I will take over from here,

285
00:20:11,310 --> 00:20:13,400
so please head on back and get some rest.

286
00:20:14,230 --> 00:20:16,020
Get out of here. That...

287
00:20:16,520 --> 00:20:18,650
...is a monster among monsters.

288
00:20:18,650 --> 00:20:21,110
What are you going to do?

289
00:20:21,110 --> 00:20:25,370
Don't worry about me. Once I've
bought you enough time to escape,

290
00:20:25,370 --> 00:20:27,160
I'll get away in no time
using teleportation magic.

291
00:20:32,250 --> 00:20:35,790
Sorry to keep you waiting.
Shall we get started right away, then?

292
00:20:35,790 --> 00:20:37,170
Hurry and get out of here!

293
00:20:38,710 --> 00:20:41,670
It would grieve me to part
so soon after meeting,

294
00:20:41,670 --> 00:20:45,390
so I will block any teleportation.
Dimensional Lock.

295
00:20:46,850 --> 00:20:49,500
Maximize Magic! Shard Buckshot!

296
00:20:52,810 --> 00:20:54,190
A nullification ability?

297
00:20:54,190 --> 00:20:56,190
Hellfire Wall!

298
00:21:02,740 --> 00:21:06,870
I did not think that level of flame
would kill them. My deepest condolences.

299
00:21:07,530 --> 00:21:11,660
I intended to hold back enough
to not kill them, based on you as a standard.

300
00:21:11,660 --> 00:21:15,370
Why did you team up together,
when there is such disparity in your abilities?

301
00:21:15,830 --> 00:21:18,380
Don't you say that about them!

302
00:21:19,000 --> 00:21:21,310
Aspect of the Devil: Giant Arm of the Demon.

303
00:21:24,550 --> 00:21:26,670
Translocation Damage!

304
00:21:31,060 --> 00:21:34,320
Penetrate Maximize Magic! Crystal Dagger!

305
00:21:37,100 --> 00:21:40,570
Even with magic to penetrate
his defense, he's unharmed?

306
00:21:40,570 --> 00:21:43,560
Aspect of the Devil: Razor Sharp Claws!

307
00:21:44,280 --> 00:21:47,670
I can't get away
while taking those two with me.

308
00:21:47,990 --> 00:21:48,950
Which means...

309
00:21:48,950 --> 00:21:50,080
Let's do this!

310
00:22:02,960 --> 00:22:06,260
So then, which one of you...

311
00:22:07,470 --> 00:22:09,230
...is my foe?

312
00:22:09,230 --> 00:22:11,230


